{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Weight"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edge"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The source is discovered first, at distance zero, with its estimate: the heuristic’s guess at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its distance to the target (zero for the target itself). Then, while a vertex is open, the one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the smallest distance plus estimate is examined (closed). When that is the target the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"search ends there. Otherwise each of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offers its target, the examined vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight, and is then relaxed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered vertex is followed by that vertex’s discovery;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one to a closed vertex, which only an inconsistent heuristic allows, by its reopening (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Boost Graph Library’s black target), after which it is examined again. After its last out-edge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the examined vertex is finished. When the target is never reached the search ends once no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex is open.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths16AStarSearchEventO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"AStarSearch.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearch.swift#L18"},"symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AStarSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AStarSearchEvent"}],"title":"AStarSearchEvent"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/AStarSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:estimate:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/Shor